{
  "id": "horsepower_required__to_pump_water",
  "title": "Horsepower Required to Pump Water",
  "description": "Calculate the water horsepower required to pump water using flow rate and head, or delivered pressure. Includes both imperial and metric unit calculations.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Horsepower Required to Pump Water\n\nEnergy imparted to water by the pump is called _water horsepower_ and can be calculated using two methods:\n\n**Method 1 - Using Flow and Head:**\n- Pwhp = q h SG / (3960 μ)\n- q = flow (gal/min)\n- h = head (ft)\n- SG = specific gravity (1 for water)\n- μ = pump efficiency (decimal)\n\n**Method 2 - Using Delivered Pressure:**\n- Pwhp = q dp / (1715 μ)\n- dp = delivered pressure (psi)\n\n**Metric Units:**\n- P = q h ρ / (6116×10³ μ)\n- q = flow (liter/min)\n- h = head (m)\n- ρ = density (kg/m³)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "calculation_method",
          "label": "Calculation Method",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Imperial - Flow and Head",
              "value": "imperial_head"
            },
            {
              "label": "Imperial - Delivered Pressure",
              "value": "imperial_pressure"
            },
            {
              "label": "Metric - Flow and Head",
              "value": "metric"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "imperial_head"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_gpm",
          "label": "Flow Rate (gal/min)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "gal/min"
        },
        {
          "id": "head_ft",
          "label": "Head (ft)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_gravity",
          "label": "Specific Gravity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "dimensionless"
        },
        {
          "id": "pump_efficiency_imperial",
          "label": "Pump Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "decimal (0-1)"
        },
        {
          "id": "delivered_pressure_psi",
          "label": "Delivered Pressure (psi)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "psi"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_liter_min",
          "label": "Flow Rate (liter/min)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "liter/min"
        },
        {
          "id": "head_m",
          "label": "Head (m)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Density (kg/m³)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "pump_efficiency_metric",
          "label": "Pump Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "decimal (0-1)"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "water_horsepower_imperial",
          "label": "Water Horsepower",
          "formula": "IF(inputs.calculation_method == 'imperial_head', (inputs.flow_gpm * inputs.head_ft * inputs.specific_gravity) / (3960 * inputs.pump_efficiency_imperial), (inputs.flow_gpm * inputs.delivered_pressure_psi) / (1715 * inputs.pump_efficiency_imperial))",
          "unit": "hp",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "power_metric",
          "label": "Power Required",
          "formula": "(inputs.flow_liter_min * inputs.head_m * inputs.density) / (6116 * 1000 * inputs.pump_efficiency_metric)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
